{#
  A body's mark in a fixed square box, fitted inside it, centred, proportions kept (Nathan, 4 October 2026: "Give
  each mark a fixed box and fit it inside, centred, with its proportions kept. Every mark then occupies the same
  space whatever its shape"; "pad by shape rather than special-casing each file").

  Sizing by shape, from the file's proportions alone:
    near square (width to height 0.9 to 1.1), which is how a round seal is saved: 94 per cent of the box, a 3 per
      cent margin each side, so a circle reads as large as the others;
    any other shape: the size at which it covers the same area as that circle (about 69 per cent of the box),
      up to the box's edge. A wide wordmark then runs the full width and a tall crest the full height, rather
      than every shape stopping at the same longest side.
  A raster file is served as a WebP copy with its alpha, no larger than `cap` pixels; the file as handed over stays
  the archive copy. The box has no fill of its own, so the page's background shows through a transparent mark.

    mark   the asset
    cap    pixels for the served copy (600 record, 400 /organizations, 200 /schools)
    box    the box: a size in pixels, or omitted to fill the parent (which sets the size)
    lazy   optional, load lazily
#}
{%- set w = mark.width ?: 1 -%}{%- set h = mark.height ?: 1 -%}
{%- set r = w / h -%}
{%- set A = 0.694 -%}
{%- if r >= 0.9 and r <= 1.1 -%}
  {%- set wp = r >= 1 ? 94 : 94 * r -%}{%- set hp = r >= 1 ? 94 / r : 94 -%}
{%- elseif r > 1 -%}
  {%- set wp = min(100, 100 * (A * r) ** 0.5) -%}{%- set hp = wp / r -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- set hp = min(100, 100 * (A / r) ** 0.5) -%}{%- set wp = hp * r -%}
{%- endif -%}
{#- A mark keeps its transparency (Nathan, 4 October 2026: "Resized copies are WebP with alpha, or PNG where WebP is not available. SVG is served as is. Never JPEG for a mark"). The format is set, not left to the source's, so a JPEG mark would come out WebP too. -#}
{%- set webp = craft.app.images.supportsWebP ?? true -%}
{%- set tr = mark.extension|lower == 'svg' ? null : { width: cap, height: cap, mode: 'fit', upscale: false, format: webp ? 'webp' : 'png', quality: 90 } -%}
<span class="mk-box" style="{{ box ?? null ? 'width:' ~ box ~ 'px;height:' ~ box ~ 'px' : 'width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1' }}"><img src="{{ mark.getUrl(tr) }}" alt="{{ mark.alt ?: mark.title }}" width="{{ w }}" height="{{ h }}" style="width:{{ wp|round(1) }}%;height:{{ hp|round(1) }}%"{% if lazy ?? false %} loading="lazy"{% endif %}></span>
{% css %}
.mk-box{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;box-sizing:border-box}
.mk-box img{display:block;max-width:none;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;aspect-ratio:auto}
{% endcss %}
